sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant Portal as Customer Portal
    participant API as Django API
    participant Service as PaymentApplicationService
    participant DB as Existing MySQL
    participant Worker as Outbox Worker
    participant Gateway as SimulatedPaymentGateway

    Customer->>Portal: Enter fictional credentials and choose scenario
    Portal->>Portal: Validate exact test tuple; clear card fields
    Portal->>API: POST order pay {idempotency_key, demo_scenario}
    API->>Service: Verify order ownership and scenario
    Service->>DB: Create/reuse Payment; add payment.requested outbox event
    API-->>Portal: 202 Accepted, payment ID/status
    Worker->>DB: Claim outbox event
    Worker->>Gateway: authorize(order, amount, idempotency_key, scenario)
    Gateway-->>Worker: SUCCEEDED / FAILED / UNKNOWN
    Worker->>DB: Persist payment state; complete event
    Portal->>API: GET order fulfillment
    API-->>Portal: Payment state and provider=EDUCATIONAL_SIMULATOR
    Portal-->>Customer: Show simulated result; no real transaction
